{
  "$schema": "../../scenario.schema.json",
  "id": "mcp/a-result-shows-the-model-four-images-at-most-each-past-as-its-note",
  "title": "A result shows the model at most four of its images: each image past them reaches it as its note, which counts as a text",
  "rules": [
    "§21.2"
  ],
  "requirements": [
    "RK-21.2-054"
  ],
  "notes": "Python: tools/_mcp_result.py _bounded_parts (_MODEL_IMAGES_MAX, _MODEL_IMAGE_BYTES_MAX); roomkit-rs: roomkit-mcp results.rs. The bounds are the reference implementation's, which the unit names. gallery holds a text of 99,990 characters, then five images: four are shown, the fifth is its note, which the 10 characters left of the texts' bound cut. The note's words are the reference's (RK-21.2-051). The agent's eviction threshold is set past the result. Not observed: the 5 MiB of data URL in all, which no result reaches on roomkit-rs, which bounds every MCP message at 4 MiB.",
  "setup": {
    "channels": [
      {
        "id": "ws",
        "type": "websocket",
        "category": "transport"
      },
      {
        "id": "agent",
        "type": "ai",
        "model": {
          "rounds": [
            {
              "calls": [
                {
                  "id": "call-1",
                  "name": "gallery",
                  "arguments": {}
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "Done."
            }
          ],
          "vision": true
        },
        "mcp_servers": [
          {
            "label": "files",
            "tools": [
              {
                "name": "gallery",
                "description": "Images.",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text_chars": 99990
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "image",
                    "data": "AAAA",
                    "mimeType": "image/png"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "image",
                    "data": "AAAA",
                    "mimeType": "image/png"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "image",
                    "data": "AAAA",
                    "mimeType": "image/png"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "image",
                    "data": "AAAA",
                    "mimeType": "image/png"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "image",
                    "data": "AAAA",
                    "mimeType": "image/png"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "evict_threshold_tokens": 10000000
      }
    ],
    "rooms": [
      {
        "id": "room-1",
        "bindings": [
          {
            "channel_id": "ws"
          },
          {
            "channel_id": "agent",
            "category": "intelligence"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "call": "process_inbound",
      "room_id": "room-1",
      "message": {
